{"url": "https://webaim.org/articles/narrator/images.htm", "silo": "webaim", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<title>Narrator Practice: Images</title>\n\t<link href=\"/styles/examplestyles.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body>\n<h1>Narrator Practice: Images</h1>\n\n<p><a href=\"/articles/narrator/#tables\">Return to the main article </a></p>\n<p>The following image has an alt attribute \"WebAIM - Web Accessibility in Mind\".</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\" alt=\"WebAIM - Web Accessibility in Mind\"></p>\n<p>The following is the same image as above, but this time without an alt attribute.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\"></p>\n<p>The following image has an <em>inappropriate</em> null, or empty alt attribute (alt=\"\").</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\" alt=\"\"></p>\n\n<h2>Images as links </h2>\n<p>The following image is a link. It has the alt attribute \"WebAIM - Web Accessibility in Mind\" and links to the WebAIM homepage.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\" alt=\"WebAIM - Web Accessibility in Mind\"></a></p>\n<p>The following image is a link with a missing alt attribute.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\"></a></p>\n<p>The following image is a link with an <em>inappropriate</em> null, or empty alt attribute (alt=\"\").</p>\n<p><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/articles/narrator/#tables\">Return to the main article </a></p>\n\n\n\n</body></html>", "links": [{"href": "https://webaim.org/articles/narrator/", "text": "Return to the main article", "title": "", "base_domain": "webaim.org", "head_data": null, "head_extraction_status": null, "head_extraction_error": null, "intrinsic_score": 0.0, "contextual_score": null, "total_score": null}, {"href": "https://webaim.org/", "text": "", "title": "", "base_domain": "webaim.org", "head_data": null, "head_extraction_status": null, "head_extraction_error": null, "intrinsic_score": 0.0, "contextual_score": null, "total_score": null}]}